<p>The term <strong class="selflink">design resource</strong>  is used to describe the subset of resources that are created within the  toolset by designers. It is used to distinguish resources created  within the toolset by artists (<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Art%20Resources" title="Art Resources">art resources</a>)  and the primary source files created using external applications (such  as modelling applications, sound editors, image editors, etc.). 
</p><p>All design resources are stored in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Dragon%20Age%20Toolset" title="Dragon Age Toolset (page does not exist)">Dragon Age Toolset</a>'s <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Database" title="Database">database</a> and must be exported prior to creating a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Builder%20to%20player" title="Builder to player">Builder to player</a>, or <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/DAZIP" title="DAZIP">DAZIP</a>, file.
</p>
